[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-001
TITLE: User Manual Identification
STATEMENT: This document shall be identified as the Software User Manual (SUM) for the Advanced Driver Assistance System (ADAS) Control Module, version 1.0, following MIL-STD-498 and automotive user documentation standards.
RATIONALE: Proper user manual identification ensures configuration management and user documentation traceability for automotive safety systems.

