[SECTION]
TITLE: 1.2 System overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-002
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The ADAS Control Module provides comprehensive driver assistance capabilities including lane departure warning, adaptive cruise control, forward collision warning, blind spot detection, and traffic sign recognition for enhanced vehicle safety and driver comfort.
RATIONALE: System overview provides users with understanding of system capabilities and benefits.

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: 1.3 Document overview

