[SECTION]
TITLE: 3. System overview

[SECTION]
TITLE: 3.1 System capabilities

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-005
TITLE: Lane Departure Warning
STATEMENT: The system shall provide lane departure warning with visual and audible alerts when the vehicle approaches lane boundaries, helping prevent unintentional lane departures and potential accidents.
RATIONALE: Lane departure warning capability enhances driver safety and accident prevention.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-006
TITLE: Adaptive Cruise Control
STATEMENT: The system shall provide adaptive cruise control that automatically maintains safe following distance and adjusts vehicle speed based on traffic conditions, enhancing driver comfort and safety.
RATIONALE: Adaptive cruise control capability enhances driver comfort and safety during highway driving.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-007
TITLE: Forward Collision Warning
STATEMENT: The system shall provide forward collision warning with escalating alerts and automatic emergency braking when potential collisions are detected, helping prevent accidents and reduce collision severity.
RATIONALE: Forward collision warning capability enhances driver safety and accident prevention.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-008
TITLE: Blind Spot Detection
STATEMENT: The system shall provide blind spot detection with visual warnings in side mirrors and audible alerts when turn signals are activated with vehicles in blind spots, enhancing driver awareness.
RATIONALE: Blind spot detection capability enhances driver awareness and prevents lane change accidents.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-009
TITLE: Traffic Sign Recognition
STATEMENT: The system shall provide traffic sign recognition that displays speed limits, stop signs, and warning signs on the instrument cluster or head-up display, enhancing driver awareness and compliance.
RATIONALE: Traffic sign recognition capability enhances driver awareness and traffic compliance.

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: 3.2 System limitations

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-010
TITLE: System Limitations
STATEMENT: The system shall have limitations including weather conditions, sensor obstructions, road conditions, and driver responsibility requirements that users must understand for safe operation.
RATIONALE: System limitations information ensures user understanding and safe system operation.

[/SECTION]

[/SECTION]

