RATIONALE: Proper installation procedures ensure system safety and performance.

[/SECTION]

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: 5. Operation

[SECTION]
TITLE: 5.1 System startup

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-013
TITLE: System Startup
STATEMENT: The system shall automatically start with vehicle ignition and perform self-diagnostic checks with status indicators on the instrument cluster or center console display.
RATIONALE: Automatic system startup ensures system availability and user awareness.

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: 5.2 Normal operation

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-014
TITLE: Normal Operation
STATEMENT: The system shall operate continuously during normal driving with automatic activation of safety features and driver notifications through visual, audible, and haptic feedback as appropriate.
RATIONALE: Continuous normal operation ensures driver safety and system effectiveness.

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: 5.3 User controls

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-015
TITLE: User Controls
STATEMENT: The system shall provide user controls for feature activation, sensitivity adjustment, and system configuration through vehicle controls, mobile applications, or web interfaces.
RATIONALE: User controls enable system customization and user preference management.

[/SECTION]

[/SECTION]

